"a0":{"x":1520,"y":0,"w":420,"text":"Assumptions (Allen was asleep, so these are my calls):\n• Name stays MusicScan; new original logo (viewfinder corners around a note).\n• Light blue chrome, white paper for the score so notes keep full contrast.\n• Rounded display type (SF Pro Rounded on Apple, Nunito fallback) for character; SF Pro / system for UI.\n• One warm accent (marigold) only for Pro and celebrations.\n• Flags stay red / amber / green but each also has a shape (triangle, dot, check) so they don't rely on colour.\n• Prices from the brief: $5.99/wk, $6.99/mo, $44.99/yr, 3 free scans a month.","size":"m","fill":"blue"},
